--- reviewed/README.md
+++ fixed/README.md
@@ -112,8 +112,19 @@
 The source directory is now `tosi` instead of `task-runners`, and the executable,
 plugin, and generated package use `tosi`. Rebuild from the renamed checkout and
 update explicit launch paths. Install `tosi@tosi-local` through the host's normal
-plugin management, then remove or disable the old Task Runners installation to
-avoid loading both servers. Refresh the host session and rediscover the tools;
+plugin management, then remove the old plugin and its catalog registration. The
+old catalog points at the moved source directory and will otherwise remain stale.
+For the previous user-scoped installations:
+
+```sh
+codex plugin remove task-runners@task-runners-local
+codex plugin marketplace remove task-runners-local
+claude plugin uninstall task-runners@task-runners-local --scope user --keep-data
+claude plugin marketplace remove task-runners-local --scope user
+```
+
+This avoids loading both servers and preserves Claude's plugin data. Refresh the
+host session and rediscover the tools;
 existing host caches do not rename themselves. MCP resource URIs now start with
 `skill://tosi/`.
 
